  "s03": {
    "duration": 23.4,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "契约只要求行为一致，至于这份契约怎么设计，就出现了两条路。",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 56457550
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "看这一行 C：给二维数组的一个元素赋值。",
        "offset": 56957550,
        "duration": 37500002
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "在 x86 上，它是一条指令。",
        "offset": 94457552,
        "duration": 29952831
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "在 MIPS 上，它是一串指令。",
        "offset": 124410384,
        "duration": 26297171
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "一条对一串，这就是复杂指令集和精简指令集的分野。",
        "offset": 150707555,
        "duration": 50117927
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "不是谁更先进，是两种设计哲学。",
        "offset": 200825482,
        "duration": 32665096
      }
    ],
