    "duration": 28.272,
    "sentences": [
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "为什么简单和规整这么重要？",
        "offset": 1000000,
        "duration": 25679246
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "因为流水线。",
        "offset": 26179246,
        "duration": 16037736
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "流水线要求每个周期，都能取到一条完整的指令。",
        "offset": 42216983,
        "duration": 42924530
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "定长四字节，取指地址加四就行，下一条在哪，永远知道。",
        "offset": 85141514,
        "duration": 54009436
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "不定长就麻烦：不译码完，不知道这条指令到底有几个字节。",
        "offset": 139150950,
        "duration": 53773587
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "所以 CISC 的取指和译码，很难整齐地排进流水线。",
        "offset": 192924538,
        "duration": 50353776
      },
      {
        "type": "SentenceBoundary",
        "text": "RISC 用长度换了规律，规律换来了并行。",
        "offset": 243278315,
        "duration": 38915096
      }
    ],
